@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 A one-line interpolation in a styled-jsx CSS template stays on one line past printWidth (tests/format/jsx/template/styled-components.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 A one-line interpolation in html and /* HTML */ templates is not broken (tests/format/js/template-literals/expression-break.js) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 An interpolation that already spans lines in a CSS template breaks at its braces and indents one level (tests/format/js/strings/template-literals.js) [AC-3]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Move the interpolation logic of printTemplateLiteral into a shared printTemplateExpression (src/language-js/print/template-literal.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Pass options to printTemplateExpressions from the css, graphql and html embeds (src/language-js/embed/css.js, src/language-js/embed/graphql.js, src/language-js/embed/html.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Add the changelog entries (changelog_unreleased/javascript/18380.md, changelog_unreleased/javascript/18380-2.md)
